# GitHub language statistics only. Canopy is a tmux plugin in Bash, awk and
# fzf; Python is optional and limited to the CLI, the agent adapters, the
# animation server and the tests. The test suite alone is around 85% of the
# Python bytes here, which is enough to present the whole repository as a
# Python project and bury what it actually is.
#
# Linguist already ignores docs/ (documentation.yml), but its vendor list
# covers testdata/ rather than tests/, so the suite counts in full.
tests/** -linguist-detectable
